Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.29,0:00:06.61,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,From the Aloma Prophesy Grimoire{Manuscript}, chapter 66, section 6:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.61,0:00:11.42,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Partners who do not dance together shall never cross paths again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.03,0:01:52.19,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Angels and Demons Neko~n.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.36,0:01:56.22,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,It's spring! It's finally spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.22,0:01:59.41,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Oh glorious students of Paprika Academy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.41,0:02:03.82,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,congratulations on your acceptance, advancement, or graduation.{graduation refers to entering middle school from the same academies elementary school}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.82,0:02:07.47,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,With the beginning of the new school year comes the joy of making new friends,{In this new environment may you join hands with new friends,}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.47,0:02:11.93,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,helping them{助け合い}, supporting them{支え合い}, and occasionally fighting, but{and} making up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.64,0:02:18.10,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,On top of that, devote yourself to your studies, sports, and PriPara!{ put everything you have into your studies, sports, and PriPara!}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.12,0:02:19.36,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yes ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.51,0:02:19.36,Default-Alt,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:24.12,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I'm so happy that the principal is finally supporting us with PriPara!{Isn't it nice that the principal has finally come to cheer for (support) PriPara}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:26.57,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,It's a complete turnaround from last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.57,0:02:28.65,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's Go on with our diligence as usual!{every day diligence!}{####### I believe this to be a pun on Go -the game- as she was once a famous Go player.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.57,0:02:28.78,Signs,Shion,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,115)\alpha&H60\p1\c&FFFFFF&\t(5090,6790,\c&H000000&)\pos(562.5,82.5)}m 397.5 0 l 1537.5 0 l 1537.5 82.5 l 397.5 82.5
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.57,0:02:28.65,Default-Alt,Shion,0,0,0,,Note: This is referring to the game of Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.65,0:02:31.82,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I hope she'll finish up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.82,0:02:32.96,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Right, Leona?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:33.54,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:35.54,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You! Don't take that off just because it's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:37.09,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,School rule number 22:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.09,0:02:39.25,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,School outfits must always be neat and clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.67,0:02:39.25,Default-Alt,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.95,0:02:42.96,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're as distinguished and cool as ever, President Minami.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.73,0:02:50.01,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Now extend your wings and quickly fly towards your shining future!{ fly vigorously towards your shining future.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.49,0:02:53.18,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Yes! Just like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.18,0:02:55.59,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Fly forth, youth!{go forth, etc. some kind of sudden movement forward (towards the future)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:58.81,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,{bg-guy}It's been a while! What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:58.81,Default-Alt,Principal,0,0,0,,{bg-girl}We're in the same class again.{we're together again}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:01.64,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,We're 6th graders now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:02.38,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:04.70,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm so happy we're in the same class again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:05.57,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:05.57,Default-Alt,Nao,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 3,0:03:06.08,0:03:08.81,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But our studies are going to be more difficult, huh?
Dialogue: 3,0:03:08.81,0:03:12.37,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,We'll just have to do our best like the principal said.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:13.56,0:03:16.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Too bad we can't live off just doing PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:16.99,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Get real.{Impossible.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.31,0:03:20.32,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,After reforming SoLaMi Smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:22.84,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'll have to work hard for the new event.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.84,0:03:25.26,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,The PriPara Dream Parade, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:27.01,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I'll be cheering for you, Lala.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.55,0:03:29.47,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{Capisce you!}Thanks, capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:34.05,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Dream Theater-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:35.93,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Five person teams-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.94,0:03:36.74,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.74,0:03:42.37,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what system they use,\NSoLaMi Smile will still end up winning-kuma.{It doesn't matter how they change the system, in the end the ones chosen will be SoLaMi Smile-kuma}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.37,0:03:46.90,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,And at that point they'll go down as legends in PriPara's history books-kuma.{At which point they will be recorded in PriPara's history books as legends-kuma.}{one page of new legends will be written in PriPara}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.11,0:03:49.65,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.65,0:03:52.41,Default,Others,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:56.01,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,They're miles above the rest-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.01,0:03:59.60,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Even if you say that, the same goes for Dressing Parfait-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:02.33,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,They will find themselves in the history books as well-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.81,0:04:06.00,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Dressing Parfait will be the ones to ride on the lead float,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:09.55,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,and ring the Charm Bell of Beginnings-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.77,0:04:12.45,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,No, no. It'll be SoLaMi Smile-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.45,0:04:15.70,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You should just recruit the two over there.{If you'd like, you can invite the two from over there.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:16.42,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:17.06,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:18.81,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,That's my line-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.81,0:04:20.45,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Don't take Dressing Parfait lightly-usa!{Don't look down on}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.45,0:04:21.45,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.93,0:04:24.53,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nyello.{nya + hello}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:29.66,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nyello.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.99,0:04:38.50,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:41.29,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Look at the two hunks-nekon.{The two of you sure are hunks-nekon.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.29,0:04:45.36,Default,Both,0,0,0,,She's charming!{they basically are head over heals for them at first sight}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.13,0:04:50.38,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Would the two of you like to come back to my place?{she says store so uh, innuendo is optional}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.38,0:04:52.98,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Hunks are always welcome-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:55.55,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I-I'll go-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:55.55,Default-Alt,Usa,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:57.85,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,{Nekokokoko}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.85,0:05:01.89,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're both thirsty after spending the day in the sun-nekon.{I'm sure the two of you are thirsty after sailing in the sun all day~nekon.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.37,0:05:03.85,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Please help yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.29,0:05:07.49,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,So is this your bar-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.49,0:05:10.55,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,The atmosphere suits you perfectly-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.55,0:05:12.07,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's very stylish-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.07,0:05:15.05,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,What smooth talkers.{"Don't be so formal" with a stupid nyaa pun}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:17.38,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,You may call me Neko-neesan-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:18.53,Default,Both,0,0,0,,We'd love to!{Happily}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.99,0:05:23.21,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What stupid lumps of cotton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.61,0:05:26.43,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,They've completely fallen into my trap.{ thoroughly fallen for my trickery.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.17,0:05:29.38,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,This pizza bun is delicious~.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.38,0:05:31.13,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Is that so-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.13,0:05:37.09,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I want to celebrate meeting two wonderful hunks by giving you a free fortune telling-nekon.{I'd like to celebrate meeting two hunks like you by giving you a free fortune reading-nekon.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.72,0:05:41.56,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll see a lovely future-nekon.{I'll read/divinate your lovely futures-nekon.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:43.61,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,O-Our fortune-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:47.02,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,But fortune tellings aren't real-usa.{realistic}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.41,0:05:49.58,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Devidevi~nyan devidevi~nyan.{pun off of divination probably}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:54.24,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Tell me what the future has in store for these two hunks-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.20,0:05:57.95,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Take a look at your lovely futures-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.41,0:06:05.37,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,{Kyaaa!!!}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.32,0:06:09.25,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,PriPara change, complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.86,0:06:13.17,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Complete-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:15.17,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Finished~.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:16.50,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:19.01,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,All right, let's get to reforming SoLaMi Smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.01,0:06:20.72,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,and have our first concert-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:26.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Promise: Believe in friendship.{naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:28.81,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Rythem: Carved in our hearts.{naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.27,0:06:31.27,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Paradise: Our goal.{naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:34.49,Default,SoLaMi,0,0,0,,We swear to stand on stage as one.{naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:37.95,Default,SoLaMi,0,0,0,,We'd like to enter as SoLaMi Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.59,0:06:39.91,Default,Meganee,0,0,0,,You can't do a live.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.91,0:06:40.99,Default,SoLaMi,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.99,0:06:42.25,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Why-pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.25,0:06:44.95,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We just took our reformation oath!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:48.62,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Even without Kuma, I thought we could enter as idols-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.83,0:06:52.48,Default,Meganee,0,0,0,,The system isn't recognising your reformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:54.03,Default,SoLaMi,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.03,0:06:57.34,Default,Meganee,0,0,0,,You didn't have a witness for the oath you just took.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:58.59,Default,SoLaMi,0,0,0,,Witness?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.59,0:07:00.00,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What do we need one for-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:03.50,Default,Meganee,0,0,0,,The ritual requires a witness.{A witness is required for the (oath )ritual.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:05.52,Default,Meganee,0,0,0,,Basically that means your manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:08.21,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I never heard about that!{first time i've head of this}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.14,0:07:08.21,Default-Alt,Mirelle,0,0,0,,This is news to me-pri.{never heard of this}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:10.73,Default,Meganee,0,0,0,,Please come back once you're reformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:12.66,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:17.19,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I can't believe it had a catch like that-pri...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:20.56,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Go'.{ｲｺﾞ - this is go, but her greeting}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:22.16,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Have you entered already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.16,0:07:23.87,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,We're going to do it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:26.83,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,We took the {oath }ritual to the max.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.73,0:07:29.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:31.26,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You pri and pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.26,0:07:32.80,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yada yada.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:33.40,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.40,0:07:34.47,Default,Dressing,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.47,0:07:36.51,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,The oath requires a witness?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.51,0:07:38.64,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:39.97,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.15,0:07:43.35,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Usagi was there when we did it back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:45.49,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Same here-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:49.36,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,They never told us anything about it-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:52.66,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I guess that means we need to get ourselves a manager quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.66,0:07:56.39,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Speaking of, I haven't seen Kuma-san for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.82,0:07:58.15,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,We neither. {former line: Us either.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.15,0:07:59.95,Default,All,0,0,0,,You neither?! {former line: You either?!}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.91,0:08:03.37,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.37,0:08:04.12,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:05.74,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,M-My hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.74,0:08:08.03,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,It all fell out-usa!{ alt: I'm naked-! >_>}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.08,0:08:11.54,Default,Both,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.78,0:08:12.83,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,My my.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.83,0:08:15.31,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Here I thought we'd see a lovely future,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:17.68,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,but it seems you're cursed-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:19.34,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Cursed-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:19.34,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Cursed-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:21.70,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Ah! Could it be you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.70,0:08:24.80,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,...haven't found who you'll team up with-nekon?{to reform your teams with-nekon?!}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.22,0:08:27.09,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,O-Of course we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.09,0:08:30.59,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Regardless of what happens, I'll be with Dressing Parfait-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:33.96,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I won't lose to some curse-kuma!{Someone like me won't lose to some curse-kuma!}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:36.52,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'll rise to the top with SoLaMi Smile-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:38.36,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.65,0:08:43.68,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,The PriPara System won't let you reform with the same team.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:45.32,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,PriPara System-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:45.32,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,PriPara System-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:46.59,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,That's right-neko!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:50.04,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,The system is predictable,\Nso when it's upset, there'll be problems.{The system is straight forward}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:52.37,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Really-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:52.37,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.37,0:08:55.75,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,B-But why would the system be upset-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:57.71,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.71,0:09:01.70,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,...teaming up with the same members wouldn't suit two hunks like you-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:05.14,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,It wants you to aim higher, so the universe...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.51,0:09:07.60,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,...is mad-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.99,0:09:10.09,Default,Both,0,0,0,,We're definitely hunks, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:11.93,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.93,0:09:14.56,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Curses aren't real-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:16.76,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:19.81,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I used to think that too-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.81,0:09:24.53,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I've seen a lot of other men who've said the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:28.88,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,But you see, Wani-san from section 1, Ahiru-san from section 6,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:32.13,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Matilda-san down in house 31, Tanuki-san in the suburbs,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:38.81,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Risu-san up near the mountains, Yooderu-san downtown, Ottose-san out on country road 3-10...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.88,0:09:41.30,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Stop-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.30,0:09:44.43,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,But a fortune...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.04,0:09:44.43,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,A curse...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:49.14,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,It breaks my heart knowing you don't believe me-nekon...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.14,0:09:50.60,Default,Both,0,0,0,,{ｽﾞｯｷｰﾝ}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:53.73,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,You're calling me a liar-neko?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.73,0:09:55.26,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'd never-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:57.06,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I'd never say something like that-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.06,0:10:00.77,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Then it means I was lying when I said you were hunks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.77,0:10:02.07,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:07.35,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Your bill is 100,000 Pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.35,0:10:12.20,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Also, don't tell anyone about it if you don't want it to come true-nekon.{Oh, also, I wouldn't tell anyone about this curse as it'll definitely come true then-neko.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:19.08,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Nekon! Nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:21.56,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:25.43,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,My nether disciple. Thou art our manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.43,0:10:26.55,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.55,0:10:34.52,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,We Alomagedon will do whatever it takes to win the Dream Theatre and become the Parade Princess.{ advance in the Dream Theater and become the Parade Princess.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.52,0:10:36.67,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,You devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.67,0:10:39.10,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,But it's best to leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:44.37,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,In any case, our plan to prevent the reformation of SoLaMi Smile and Dressing Parfait is going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.37,0:10:46.04,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Those guys are free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.04,0:10:49.82,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,My Angel, now is the time to lead them into temptation!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.17,0:10:51.20,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:56.36,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,So that we, the Alomagedon, may stand at the peak of idolism,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:11:01.41,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I will form the perfect five person team which shall create the heavens and the earth!{keep this grandiose}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.41,0:11:04.42,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,We must get ourselves another three members.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:06.92,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,First I'll capture the angel, Manaka Lala!{One shall be the one with an angelic frame; Manaka Lala! -these lines are rather literal, instead of having frames it could just be "angelic" and "demonic", but this is Aloma so this is still an option}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:07.63,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.63,0:11:10.07,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Second shall be the demon, Dorthy West!{Another will be the one with a demonic frame; Dorthy West!}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:10.59,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Chuu~.{kiss}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.59,0:11:12.84,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,And last shall be a mixture of both, Toudou Shion!{the one who is a cross of both; Toudou Shion!}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.84,0:11:13.64,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:15.81,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Be it white or black, I delight in them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.13,0:11:18.91,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The devil desires these three.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.91,0:11:20.58,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Temptation Angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:21.78,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:23.72,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The wheel of fate has begun to spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.72,0:11:25.78,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,It can no longer be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:28.46,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,This shall be the final war between angels and demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:31.82,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,And it will give birth to the greatest\NDream Team the world has ever known!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.82,0:11:32.88,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:33.78,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.34,0:11:35.38,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Its name shall be:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:37.51,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Dream Alomagedon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.31,0:11:53.35,Default,All,0,0,0,,We can't reform?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.11,0:11:57.78,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,When it comes to reforming...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.78,0:11:59.81,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You don't need to be in a rush-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.21,0:12:01.75,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What do you mean-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.21,0:12:01.75,Default-Alt,Shion,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.75,0:12:03.77,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We want to reform right away-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.75,0:12:03.77,Default-Alt,Shion,0,0,0,,We want to reform right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.77,0:12:05.04,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Impossible-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.04,0:12:06.58,Default,Both,0,0,0,,No, it's impossible-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.04,0:12:06.58,Default-Alt,Both,0,0,0,,No, it's impossible-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:08.16,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}If you reform...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.16,0:12:09.99,Default,Usa,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}If you reform...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.99,0:12:13.55,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,...a terrible curse will befall us-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.99,0:12:13.55,Default-Alt,Usa,0,0,0,,...a terrible curse will befall us-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.51,0:12:15.40,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,A curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:16.41,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What are you talking about-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:19.97,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,There's no way that'll happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.97,0:12:21.08,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,It's unscientific!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:22.93,Default,Both,0,0,0,,That's what we kept saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.93,0:12:24.64,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,That's something non-believers would do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.64,0:12:27.27,Default,Usa,0,0,0,,But millions have been affected by this curse-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.27,0:12:28.67,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What kind of curse-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:29.63,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Tell us-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.22,0:12:35.64,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,{\i1}{consistency}Also, don't tell anyone about it if you don't want it to come true-nekon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.91,0:12:37.85,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Anything but that-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.91,0:12:37.85,Default-Alt,Usa,0,0,0,,Anything but that-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:39.81,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Out with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.93,0:12:39.81,Default-Alt,Both,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.17,0:12:41.77,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I don't get it-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.05,0:12:43.35,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.35,0:12:46.59,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,The ones who'll be cursed are Kuma and Usagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.59,0:12:47.73,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.59,0:12:47.73,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.73,0:12:50.32,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That means we have nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:51.94,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,All right, let's reform.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:53.88,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:54.28,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:54.28,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:55.74,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.74,0:12:59.19,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,My calculations show that we'll be fine if we make a few sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:01.00,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,All right, take your PriTickets out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.23,0:13:04.46,Default,All,0,0,0,,Promise: Believe in friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.46,0:13:06.78,Default,All,0,0,0,,Rhythm: Carved in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:08.17,Default,All,0,0,0,,Paradise: Our go{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.35,0:13:12.86,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,There's no way we're going to watch-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.35,0:13:12.86,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,There's no way we're going to watch-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.86,0:13:14.80,Default,All,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:14.80,Default-Alt,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:17.89,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.89,0:13:19.95,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,A curse? You've got to be kidding-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.95,0:13:23.66,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,We'll finish the ritual even if we have to tie them up when we catch them!{Even if we have to tie them up when we catch them, we'll complete the ritual!}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.66,0:13:26.07,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's split up and search for them-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.07,0:13:27.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.07,0:13:27.33,Default-Alt,Others,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:32.72,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Geez! I just don't get what Mr. Kuma is thinking!{There are times I just can't understand what Mr. Kuma is thinking!}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:35.45,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Kuma-san!  Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:37.51,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:39.45,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Kuma-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.57,0:13:42.00,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Kuma-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.86,0:13:45.62,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Kuma-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.59,0:13:48.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.69,0:13:50.94,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,That is far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.94,0:13:52.76,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,W-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.76,0:13:53.34,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:55.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It's just a weather charm!{Teruteru Bozu}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:58.10,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Geez, looked just like him, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.10,0:14:01.77,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Yes, just like that foolish lump of cotton.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.93,0:14:05.23,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I met you yesterday. You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:06.77,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,..the demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.77,0:14:09.24,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Yes, I am the demon Aloma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:10.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Aloma-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.85,0:14:12.29,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm Lala.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.29,0:14:14.57,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Turn your face in the direction of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.57,0:14:15.74,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,H-Hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.74,0:14:16.66,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:17.58,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Down?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:22.10,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.10,0:14:23.64,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,A magic circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.64,0:14:24.16,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.44,0:14:26.67,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I've caught you in my magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.67,0:14:28.13,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Derodero Derosaimu!{ﾃﾞﾛﾃﾞﾛﾃﾞﾛｯｻｲﾑ！}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:29.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:30.65,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.65,0:14:31.40,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:31.84,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:35.09,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Ye shall not escape from my magic!{has no way to escape from my magic!}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:39.45,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Thine actions shall be in accordance with this prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.07,0:14:45.10,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Two demons, two angels, and one who is a mixture of both shall open the gates of heaven and hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.10,0:14:47.33,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,...and let ring the sound of heavenly gospels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.33,0:14:51.11,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,On the day of our judgement, we shall fly into the distant skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.11,0:14:53.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,So! I have no idea what you're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.37,0:14:58.51,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Jello!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.25,0:15:02.95,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma said let's form a five person Dream Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.37,0:15:05.91,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,And it's name shall be Dream Alomagedon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.23,0:15:07.61,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,An Aloma bowl?{An Aloma-don(bowl)?!}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.33,0:15:11.48,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Not a bowl!{Not that kind of don!}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.48,0:15:12.79,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,That's not "an", either.{isn't that a ge}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:14.50,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:17.45,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,you shall become our partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.45,0:15:18.97,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Let's get along-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:23.61,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,If you choose not to, that bear shall suffer under a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.61,0:15:24.56,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.97,0:15:26.81,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Let's be happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.06,0:15:29.14,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Let's have your answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.14,0:15:30.65,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Come on! Out with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.65,0:15:33.40,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Are you okay with him suffering under a curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.40,0:15:35.69,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,If you say yes, he'll be saved.{pun on safe and jesus and her being an angel, and other things}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.01,0:15:38.15,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Come on! That's enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.59,0:15:41.02,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm SoLaMi Smile's Lala!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:42.82,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I won't give into something like a curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.82,0:15:47.79,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I want to be with Mirelle and Sophie forever and ever!{maybe consider keeping as two lines}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.81,0:15:51.29,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Oh, well said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.29,0:15:54.63,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,This is exactly why one such as you is worth tempting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.34,0:15:58.98,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,We had a little fun in place of our greeting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.98,0:16:01.99,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Thoroughly cleanse your soul and wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.99,0:16:06.18,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,By that she means we'll be making our idol début today, so come watch us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:14.32,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.75,0:16:15.65,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,They're gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:18.54,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What's with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:20.15,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:29.79,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:31.92,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.62,0:16:34.74,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.59,0:16:38.46,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Mikan-chan's theme is obviously that of an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.46,0:16:42.79,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,One's heart will be cleansed by the purity of its light green and white colours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:44.89,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Sweet Angel White Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.57,0:16:46.83,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:50.70,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Aloma's theme is obviously that of a devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.70,0:16:54.50,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The aggressive design of the skirt will snatch away the eyes of any who gaze upon it.{basically that it's rebellious and that it is eye catching}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:57.24,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Cheeky Little Succubus Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:59.04,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Debi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.74,0:17:07.49,Default-Alt,Crowd,0,0,0,,Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:07.49,Default,Crowd2,0,0,0,,{\an8}So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:09.45,Default-Alt,Crowd3,0,0,0,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.84,0:17:09.45,Default,Crowd3,0,0,0,,{\an8}Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:10.85,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.85,0:17:12.50,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,This is our first battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.89,0:17:16.07,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Shining!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.77,0:17:17.96,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Please listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.47,0:17:22.42,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Those who pass through PriPara's gate, abandon all hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.01,0:17:27.26,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,No, an angel shall save your soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.10,0:17:28.93,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Aloma and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.93,0:17:29.68,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:31.96,Default,Both,0,0,0,,An angel and demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.96,0:17:34.35,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,...shall take you to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.35,0:17:35.98,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,No, to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:38.17,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,{\an8}They're funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.17,0:17:38.98,Default,Crowd2,0,0,0,,{\an8}Take me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.78,0:17:41.23,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Not bad-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:48.68,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,Alomagedon's "Devi & Reversible-Ring".
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:03.73,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.19,0:19:08.69,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Go, my servants!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:12.66,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Huh?{Eeeek!}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.75,0:19:19.55,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,Dazzling PriParapedia Labyrinth!{めくるめく ﾌﾟﾘﾊﾟﾗﾍﾟﾃﾞｨｱﾗﾋﾞﾘﾝｽ！}{alt PriPara Library Labrynth if you want to go liberal, it's based off like wiki>pedia<}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:26.13,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:32.64,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Debi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.30,0:20:16.77,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.77,0:20:17.95,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,They're pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.95,0:20:18.87,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.87,0:20:21.35,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I can't believe this is their first concert.{I can't believe today is their debut}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.06,0:20:23.96,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,An angel and demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.96,0:20:27.07,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,An existence that runs contrary to itself, just like Go.{going to assume she means black and white being opposites}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.36,0:20:29.03,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Neko-neesan-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:33.49,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Neko-neesan is quite the manager-usa.{a formidable manager}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.53,0:20:39.65,Default,Mega-neesan,0,0,0,,Purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.65,0:20:41.21,Default,Mega-neesan,0,0,0,,Aloma-chan has cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.65,0:20:47.63,Default,Mega-neesan,0,0,0,,Pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.63,0:20:49.33,Default,Mega-neesan,0,0,0,,Mikan-chan has lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:55.01,Default,Mega-neesan,0,0,0,,I'm sure you two could form a team quickly if you look for three more members.{The two of you can probably form a five person team quickly if you look for three more members.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.09,0:20:57.45,Default,Mega-neesan,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.45,0:21:00.52,Default,Mega-neesan,0,0,0,,They rose to upcoming idols right after they made their PriPara début!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:04.47,Default,Mega-neesan,0,0,0,,Alomagedon has given us a smashing début.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.51,0:21:12.02,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,What a splendid debut-neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:13.88,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,You've increased your charm-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:15.11,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Well of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.11,0:21:15.99,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.27,0:21:21.04,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Crap!{why do I want to put shnikies!}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:22.17,Default,2,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.17,0:21:23.19,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.19,0:21:24.39,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Lala?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.57,0:21:28.21,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's go to heaven together.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.67,0:21:30.92,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thus begins our trip to hell.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:32.66,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,W-What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:34.88,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It's no longer capisce!{it was capisce}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.86,0:23:09.19,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You've got to be joking if you think you can just scout Lala-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.19,0:23:12.65,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Nothing you do can go against a demon's prophecy!{There's nothing you can do to go against a devils prophesy.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.65,0:23:13.73,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.73,0:23:15.07,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,They don't exist-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.07,0:23:16.21,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You're making me laugh-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.21,0:23:19.39,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Then my curse shall befall you as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.39,0:23:21.64,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Like I said, curses don{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.64,0:23:22.80,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.80,0:23:25.16,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Strange things are happening one after another!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.16,0:23:26.62,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Could they be real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.62,0:23:29.26,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I miscalculated-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.26,0:23:29.87,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.87,0:23:31.86,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,A Cursed Solo Concert-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.86,0:23:33.30,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.30,0:23:34.84,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
